  <note xmi:id="_6Ey-hcmCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ" opaque="true" posX="32" posY="0" sizeHeight="129" sizeWidth="641" text="To Check the Result:&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;1. Deploy DemoREST or DemoRESTRoute to Talend ESB Runtime&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;Note, that DemoREST currently works only with GET requests, so ADD,&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;UPDATE and DELETE cases will fail.&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;2. Run this Job on Studio&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;3. Check the log output from Console"/>
  <subjob xmi:id="_6Ey-hsmCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ">
